This is the folder which you can use to build the hoja baseband flasher tool page with NPM.
Run
npm install
then
npm run build

cheers
Offline updaters (no browser needed; both use esptool, which resets the module correctly):
  hoja-local-updater-win.zip   Windows: esptool.exe + hoja_wireless_update.bat
  hoja_wireless_update.sh      Linux/macOS: bash hoja_wireless_update.sh [bridge|baseband]
Both install the HCI bridge (current controller firmware) by default, or the HOJA baseband.
